<title>USA: Voxware IPO shares lowered, price range up.</title>
<headline>Voxware IPO shares lowered, price range up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of the initial public offering of Voxware Inc were decreased while the price range was increased, lead underwriter for the deal, Montgomery Securities, said Friday.</p>
<p>Shares of the offering were lowered to three million, from four million, and the price range increased to $11 to $13 a share, from $7 to $8, Montgomery said.</p>
<p>The lead underwriter added that the IPO, with a proposed trading symbol of &quot;VOXW&quot; on the Nasdaq market, is expected to price the week of October 21, 1996.</p>
<p>Voxware Inc, a New Jersey-based company, makes voice-processing software for the Internet.</p>
